~ start
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(700.0, 700.0), 0.4, 1, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(35000.0,3200), 0.75, 1.5, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: Hello? Winston?
Az: I know the light's here, gimme a sec.
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(700.0.0, 700.0), 0.6, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Lights flash on.
Az: Hmph. Everything [i]looks[/i] okay.
Az: Wait, the pict-[wait=0.3] oh. Huh.
Winston grit: [font_size=100]WELCOME, [shake level=15 rate=50]FOOLS[/shake][/font_size]
Camera pans out to reveal machine
#do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0.0, 0.0), 1, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: [i]Whoa.[/i] Nevermind.
Az: Wait- [font_size=60][i]THAT'S[/i][/font_size] what you look like?
Winston grit: [font_size=80][shake level=7 rate=30][i]WHAT?![/i][/shake] WHAT DO THEE MEANETH??[/font_size] 
Az laugh: You're just, like,[wait=0.3] a skinny nerd.
Winston awkward: [font_size=30]Ahem.[/font_size] 
Winston: [font_size=100][shake level=7 rate=30][i]BEHOLDETH![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Fenn starry: [font_size=100][wave freq=10 amp=30]BY THE SENDER! IT'S-[/wave][/font_size]
Fenn worry: [font_size=70] It-[/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=50] What-[/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=40] what is it?[/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=70]MY LATEST CREATION.[/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=100][wave freq=10 amp=30]THE ICI-CLONE!![/wave][/font_size]
Winston: Thou see, my power is limited. I may [i]maketh[/i] things. 
Winston: Tools. Devices. [wave freq=7 amp=20]Creatures[/wave].
Winston grit: But I cannot [i]controleth[/i] them.
Winston: [font_size=70]SO![/font_size] I thought to myself... [i]what CAN I controleth?[/i]
Az: [font_size=35][i]Your incompetence?[/i][/font_size]
Fenn starry: [font_size=60][wave freq=7 amp=30]Your attitude??[/wave][/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=100][shake level=7 rate=30]I CAN CONTROLETH MYSELF![/shake][/font_size]
Az: [font_size=40]Huh.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: Uh oh.
Winston grit: Why, if I maketh a copyeth of [wave freq=7 amp=20]myself[/wave]...
Winston: Wouldst it not want the same things I want? 
Winston grit: [wave freq=7 amp=20][i]Wouldst it not do the same things I wouldst?[/i][/wave]
Fenn: [font_size=60][i]Bring it on!! [/i][wave freq=7 amp=30]I shalt free the Knights from thy grasp!!![/wave][/font_size]
Az: Wait, Fenn, hold on. 
Winston: [font_size=80]THUS! WITNESS THE CREATION!![/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=80] OF THE ONE. THE ONLY.[/font_size]
Winston: [font_size=100][shake level=10 rate=30][i]ICETON!![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Machine whirs, and opens
Smoke bellows and then clears to reveal an ice version of winston
Winston: [font_size=40]Holy sh- [wait=0.3]it [i]worked[/i]? [/font_size]
Winston grit: [font_size=60]IT WORKED!![/font_size]
Fenn worry: Are we in danger?
Az: Hmph. Maybe.
Winston grit: [font_size=80]ICETON, GO! [wait=0.3] [shake level=7 rate=30]DESTROYETH THEM![/shake][/font_size]
Iceton takes a few steps towards Az and Fenn. Az and Fenn retreat in sync.
Fenn worry: Uh oh.
Iceton turns around, rushes towards Winston, and starts beating him up.
Az: Huh?
Fenn worry: Winston?
Winston grit: NO! [font_size=40]No no... [/font_size][font_size=60][i][shake level=7 rate=30]STOP THIS![/shake][/i][/font_size]
Winston grit: Y- you're my creation! [font_size=60]You're ME! [shake level=7 rate=30][i]Listen to me!![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Winston awkward: Wh- why are you attacking me?[font_size=40] P- please, [i]stop![/i][/font_size]
Az: Dang. Really thought... ah, nevermind.
Fenn worry: [i]Az![/i] We have to help him!
Az: [i]Ugh...[/i]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.4")
Fenn: He's in danger! He needs h-
Az annoy: [font_size=60][i]I know![/i][/font_size] I'll get him.
Fenn: What can I do?
Az: Remember that other heater I mentioned? Past my workshop?
Fenn: Yeah? Oh!
Az: I'll protect Winston in the meantime. It might just be enough to melt Iceton.
Az: The door at the back should lead you to it.
Fenn: On it!
do EventFlags.set_flag("13-AzWs-FinalConfrontation-Workshop", true)
=> END